# Mutation plan for the plugin API's session, access-token, auth-data, OAuth-app, role and group
# methods (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 6).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-api-auth.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_auth_methods_answer_as_go_answers`: the auth
# script from inside MessageWillBePosted on a Go host and a Rust host, unlicensed and then licensed,
# every answer, every hook the writes fire, every frame of the side's own user, and the Go-read
# assertions. The fixture group has AllowReference off so that a read filtering on it misses. The
# last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

